Preserve app and workflow identity when deduplicating REST check runs in watch-pr.

- Previously `fastChecks` deduplicated solely by `${name}/${workflowName}/${event}`,
  causing two independent non-Actions apps reporting the same check name (e.g. `build`)
  to collide and drop a failing check when the other app passed.
- Include `app.id`/`app.slug` and `workflow.workflow_id` in the deduplication key, and
  preserve runs with incomplete identity instead of dropping them.
- Add a regression test in `cloud-reader.test.ts` covering two apps sharing `build`.

